  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENHANCING TIGER CONSERVATION IN SHUKLAPHANTA NATIONAL PARK</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PURPOSE OF THIS PROJECT IS TO ENHANCE OVERALL PROTECTION EFFORTS IN SHUKLAPHANTA NATIONAL PARK (SHNP) THROUGH IMPROVED PARK INFRASTRUCTURE AND INCREASED LOCAL ENGAGEMENT. PROJECT OBJECTIVES INCLUDE: (1) IMPROVED PARK INFRASTRUCTURE TO ENHANCE PROTECTION IN SHNP AND, (2) ENHANCED LOCAL COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT AND STEWARDSHIP IN TIGER CONSERVATION.</narrative>
  </description>
